the work for themselves.

00:03:00.570 --> 00:03:01.830
- Absolutely.

00:03:01.830 --> 00:03:04.650
- I'm currently in the
process of talking to a couple

00:03:04.650 --> 00:03:07.840
of people but also been
like in this place too where

00:03:09.300 --> 00:03:12.300
it's doing what we do, too,
