bit, but when it does happen,

00:03:27.150 --> 00:03:28.650
I do feel like it, it doesn't...

00:03:28.650 --> 00:03:30.150
In anyone's career,
you could be hitting it

00:03:30.150 --> 00:03:31.380
for like years and years and years,

00:03:31.380 --> 00:03:32.850
